336	    /**
337	     * Rolls a registration date forward onto a business day: when it falls on a Saturday or Sunday
338	     * it advances to the following Monday, otherwise it is returned unchanged. Applied to the
339	     * effective registration date (whether supplied in the request or defaulted to the server date)
340	     * so a weekend value never persists as an owner's {@code registrationDate}.
